[Music]  October is always a particularly busy  period in Brussels and this year is no  different  all of the EU leaders are currently  arriving here for the European Council  meeting with brexit internal and  cybersecurity climate change a migration  of all on the agenda so we thought we'd  give you a behind-the-scenes look at all  of the action from day one let's take a  look at the red carpet the topic of  discussion for day one is of course  brexit and once each of the 27 EU  leaders have passed along this red  carpet they will be briefed on the state  of play of negotiations by both Theresa  May and Michel Barnier so while those  discussions are happening what goes on  elsewhere it's not just the politicians  who are working cards at the European  Council as well as civil servants and  security staff journalists descend on  Brussels in their thousands to cover the  meeting and attend the plethora of press  conferences which follow the biggest  headlines in the world are being written  in this room right now  speaking of press conferences here we  are outside the national press briefing  of France where Emmanuel macron is  currently addressing the media and  giving his thoughts following the  conclusion of the European Council  meeting national press conferences allow  leaders the opportunity to talk to their  media and also gives journalists the  opportunity to grill their leaders on  some serious subject matters so now it's  after 11:00 p.m. and that is the end of  the European Council for today  more information is available on our  website Concilium dr. Alberto see you  and our social media channels so keep  your eyes peeled and see you next time

